stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Initiated

    Initiated --> FundsHeld : Fraud checks passed and sufficient funds
    Initiated --> Rejected : Fraud check failed or insufficient funds

    FundsHeld --> SentToBiller : Payment request sent

    SentToBiller --> Completed : Biller confirms payment
    SentToBiller --> Failed : Biller explicitly refuses payment
    SentToBiller --> Unknown : Timeout after 10 seconds

    Unknown --> Completed : Callback, retry, or settlement file confirms payment
    Unknown --> Failed : Biller refuses or reconciliation finds no payment

    Failed --> Refunded : Held funds released to wallet

    Completed --> [*]
    Rejected --> [*]
    Refunded --> [*]
